@ifinfo 
This user manual contains current Emacsvox operating guidance and selected
historical Emacspeak material.  Begin with Getting Started, then continue to
Speech Backends and Basic Usage.  Exact commands, options, and keymaps are in
the separate Emacsvox Reference Manual.  Heritage is grouped after the
current-user route and is preserved for background, not as current setup
instructions.  For rapidly evolving Omnivox and Aural Presentation details,
also consult @file{Readme.org} and
@file{etc/aural-presentation-reference.org} in the source tree.

